overview: |
  <p>FinFlow is a modern, intuitive, and secure application designed to help you take full control of your financial life. The twist? The entire application is built with <strong>Flutter</strong>, delivering a slick, high-performance experience on <strong>Mobile (Android &amp; iOS), Web, and Desktop (Windows)</strong> — all from a single codebase.</p>
  <p>The goal was to truly test the power of Flutter's cross-platform capabilities, using <strong>Supabase</strong> as a fast, open-source backend.</p>
