learning: |
  <p>This project was a deep dive into building a complete, production-ready application from a single codebase. It was an incredible opportunity to develop practical skills in cross-platform development, Backend-as-a-Service (Supabase), advanced state management with Provider, responsive UI/UX design, declarative routing with GoRouter, PostgreSQL schema design, and full-stack integration.</p>
